# Moving about the desk (v0.8). Dickey: SPACE with nothing in the book;
# 1 does nothing; A over the page edge (840: page 2, '^' in the margin), Q
# back (900: page 1, its last line); ENTER then X (back, nothing stamped).
# Wilson: L over the book's page edge (1200), P back; his line 1 against
# Dickey's: WORD FOR WORD, then the same pair again (1360: in hand already,
# not lit). The stamp list: 1 cycles Word for word, Let it lie, Corroborates
# (1480, 1520); X keeps the choice (1600); Let it lie: entered as sworn,
# found but not written (1760). Gilmour: 9 does nothing, 1 turns the book
# to Dickey (1900).
